{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content included in this demo version:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three bosses from the Forest, the first of six regions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 characters (with more to come)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 40 skills and 70 loot items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SAMUKID tells the story of a child traveling with a blind samurai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Join the eccentric samurai and become the protagonist of this legendary journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917540/extras/d5d2c5b8f9672c4e860e003aac5a326c.avif?t=1759049047\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917540/extras/5e1a9108000d7fa84c571563c83fdded.poster.avif?t=1759049047\" width=996 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917540/extras/5e1a9108000d7fa84c571563c83fdded.webm?t=1759049047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917540/extras/5e1a9108000d7fa84c571563c83fdded.mp4?t=1759049047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0Prepare for the powerful Boss that appears after 15 days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Collect loot, acquire and enhance skills, and perfect your own fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Harness the synergy of skills and loot to defeat the final Boss and prove your strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917540/extras/264157e6f42fa5ecbc4b6ce3a38a418d.avif?t=1759049047\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917540/extras/a8a9aa5b360470b5adecc7f236cf7091.poster.avif?t=1759049047\" width=996 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917540/extras/a8a9aa5b360470b5adecc7f236cf7091.webm?t=1759049047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917540/extras/a8a9aa5b360470b5adecc7f236cf7091.mp4?t=1759049047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0Grow stronger through various events and rewards over 15 days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Use loot and gold gained from defeating monsters to reinforce your strategies, secure essential items through trade, or recruit powerful companions through special events to strengthen your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Through the combination of skills, loot, companions, and choices, craft your unique strategy and experience new battles every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917540/extras/d0876bb351a5f6d67a6384a69c1d6c02.avif?t=1759049047\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http